AWS DevOps Interview Preparation – Git & GitHub (6 Years Experience)
For a 6-year experienced AWS DevOps Engineer, interviewers generally expect more than basic Git commands. They want to know how you use Git in real-time projects, manage branches, resolve conflicts, handle production issues, maintain code quality, and integrate GitHub with CI/CD pipelines.

I'll prepare you from an experienced DevOps engineer's perspective, with practical scenarios, troubleshooting commands, and interview-ready answers.

6 Years Experience Level
Topics covered

Git fundamentals and advanced commands

Git branching strategies

GitHub Pull Requests and merging

Merge conflicts and troubleshooting

